# HAGU selection pills & cards

Use `lib/hagu-selection-styles.ts` for all selectable UI. **Never use teal accent** (`border-hagu-accent-strong`, `bg-hagu-accent-soft`) for selected states.

## Pills / chips (multi-select tags)

```tsx
import { selectionPillClass } from "@/lib/hagu-selection-styles"

<button className={selectionPillClass(isSelected, "compact")}>{label}</button>
```

- **Selected:** `bg-hagu-heading text-hagu-white` (solid black)
- **Unselected:** white background, `border-hagu-border`, `text-hagu-label`

Prefer `SegmentedPillGroup` for standard pill groups.

## Selectable cards / rows

```tsx
import { selectionCardClass, selectionCheckIndicatorClass } from "@/lib/hagu-selection-styles"
```

- **Selected card:** `border-2 border-hagu-heading` on white
- **Check indicator:** filled `bg-hagu-heading` circle with white check

## Do not use for selection

- `bg-hagu-accent-soft` / `border-hagu-accent-strong` — accent is for badges, banners, focus rings only
- Per-component `selectedPillClass` constants — import shared helpers instead
